From e12b8e5beafdb7a40589bc7fd8ef724d0584a582 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 04:55:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] CUSTOM: eye colour and marking per character -
 character_customizations (F-151)

- CMSG_CHAR_CREATE: eye and marking after the outfit, saved in the create transaction
- SMSG_CHAR_ENUM: ZEPC trailer (guid, eye, marking) from two columns appended to CHAR_SEL_ENUM
- login: UNIT_FIELD_PADDING byte 0 eye, byte 1 marking; field now PUBLIC
- full delete removes the rows

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01URnr7tKsFMZq4VFsSKkj3S
